        "problem": "Find ${f}^{\u2032}(x)$ if $f(x)={5}^{x}-cot\u2061x.$",
        "worked_solution": "We take the derivative of each term and then add them, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({5}^{x}-cot\u2061x) \\\\  & ={5}^{x}ln\u20615-(-{csc}^{2}\u2061x) \\\\  & ={5}^{x}ln\u20615+{csc}^{2}\u2061x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
